@startuml

hide footbox
title To get the list of items on direct sale of a given author

actor Buyer
participant ":System" as System

Buyer -> System : **1** I want to get the list of items on direct sale of a given author
Buyer <-- System : **2** Which author? Please select!
Buyer -> System : **3** author
System --> Buyer : **4** List of items on direct sale

@enduml